graph TB
    subgraph Binary["praxis-extproc binary (Rust, tokio + tonic)"]
        Main["praxis_extproc entrypoint<br/>-c config, --grpc-address,<br/>--health-address, --metrics-address, -t"]
        FIPS["fips module<br/>OpenSSL rustls CryptoProvider<br/>PRAXIS_REQUIRE_FIPS gate"]
        TLS["tls module<br/>OpenSSL SslAcceptor<br/>TLS 1.2+, ALPN h2<br/>none / self_signed / provided"]
        Server["server / handlers / protocol / response<br/>ExternalProcessor bidi stream<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS"]
        Adapter["adapter / pipeline<br/>ExtProc to HttpFilterContext<br/>request + response phases"]
        Limits["grpc_limits / response_mode<br/>GRPC_MAX_RECV_MSG_SIZE<br/>buffered vs full-duplex streamed"]
        Health["health module<br/>grpc.health.v1 on 50052/TCP"]
        Metrics["metrics module<br/>Prometheus on 9090/TCP<br/>/metrics TokenReview + SAR, /healthz open"]
        Proto["praxis-proxy-proto<br/>vendored Envoy ext_proc.proto"]

        Main -->|installs first| FIPS
        Main -->|builds| TLS
        Main -->|starts| Server
        Main -->|starts| Health
        Main -->|starts| Metrics
        TLS -->|terminates TLS for| Server
        Server -->|per message| Adapter
        Server -->|uses| Limits
        Server -->|codegen from| Proto
    end

    subgraph Filters["Praxis filter catalogue (crates)"]
        Core["praxis-proxy-filter 0.7.4<br/>headers, json_body, request_id"]
        AI["praxis-ai-filters v0.9.0<br/>llmisvc_model_provider_resolver,<br/>OpenAI Responses, AWS SigV4"]
    end
    Adapter -->|runs FilterPipeline| Core
    Adapter -->|runs FilterPipeline| AI

    subgraph K8s["Kubernetes resources (odh overlay, openshift-ingress)"]
        Pre["Deployment + Service<br/>payload-pre-processing<br/>pre-auth BBR chain<br/>/etc/praxis/pre-extproc.yaml"]
        Post["Deployment + Service<br/>payload-processing<br/>post-auth IPP chain<br/>/etc/praxis/extproc.yaml"]
        CM["ConfigMap<br/>payload-processing-plugins"]
        EF["EnvoyFilter payload-processing<br/>2 ext_proc filters + TLS clusters<br/>failure_mode_allow: false"]
        DR["DestinationRules<br/>TLS SIMPLE, service-CA"]
        NP["NetworkPolicy"]
        SM["ServiceMonitor + metrics Service 9090"]
    end
    CM -->|mounted /etc/praxis| Pre
    CM -->|mounted /etc/praxis| Post
    Pre -.->|runs image| Main
    Post -.->|runs image| Main

    Gateway["MaaS Gateway Envoy<br/>maas-default-gateway"] -->|configured by| EF
    EF -->|ext_proc ipp-pre, before Kuadrant| Pre
    EF -->|ext_proc ipp, after Kuadrant| Post
    Kuadrant["Kuadrant Wasm<br/>Authorino / Limitador"] -.->|filter ordering| EF
    Controller["ai-gateway-controller / MaaS"] -->|deploys overlay via PostRender| K8s
    ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"] -->|issues TLS Secrets| Pre
    ServiceCA -->|issues TLS Secrets| Post
    Metrics -->|TokenReview / SAR| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    Prometheus["Prometheus<br/>redhat-ods-monitoring"] -->|scrapes| SM

